# Keep the build context small and clean — the build stage reinstalls and rebuilds from source.
# Adapted from Rackbops/artifact-console's own .dockerignore (design.md section 3/8); trimmed the
# two AC-specific lines (its own generated public/ dir, which Kenzen's K4-2 placeholder still
# needs in-context, and its deploy/answers.env* -- Kenzen has no answers-file render step yet).
**/node_modules
.git
.github
docs
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.claude
# Operator secrets never enter the image context.
deploy/.env*
